<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Taste</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>taste &lt;food or drink&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>taste bread
</pre>
<p>Takes a small bite of food, instead of eating it all (see <a cmd='#'>Help Eat</a>): a 
mouthful at a time, until it is gone. Tasting a drink does the same as 
sipping it (see <a cmd='#'>Help Sip</a>).
</p><p>Beware: a taste is still food. If the food is poisoned, even a bite 
poisons you. You can't taste when you are too full to eat.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Eat</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sip</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Drink</a>
</pre>




</div>